{"answeredBy":"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)","answers":{"Q-1":"Build the role model so Account Manager can be added later, but don't expose it now","Q-2":"Buyer sees all orders and invoices of their company","Q-3":"Unpaid past a single configurable payment term (e.g. 30 days from invoice date)","Q-4":"Create, edit and retire on products, categories, price lists/prices, customer companies and users, with who/when and changed fields; admins only","Q-5":"No: customers select from addresses managed by staff/admin"},"asked":[{"category":"roles","id":"Q-1","impact":3,"impactReason":"Decides who can see which company's orders and invoices.","options":["No: first release has Buyer, Office Staff and Administrator only","Yes: build Account Manager alongside Buyer","Build the role model so Account Manager can be added later, but don't expose it now"],"reason":"The request calls it optional and an open point. Leaving it out is the smallest complete scope.","recommended":"No: first release has Buyer, Office Staff and Administrator only","score":9,"spans":["I-5","I-9","I-17"],"text":"Is the Customer Account Manager role part of the first release?","topic":"roles","uncertainty":3},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-2","impact":3,"impactReason":"Controls who sees which orders and invoices.","options":["Buyer sees all orders and invoices of their company","Buyer sees only orders they placed and the invoices for those orders"],"reason":"Section 3.1 says the buyer can 'View their company's orders', and staff-created orders must show in the customer's history.","recommended":"Buyer sees all orders and invoices of their company","score":9,"spans":["I-5","I-15"],"text":"Should a Buyer see every order and invoice for their company, or only the orders they placed (plus their invoices)?","uncertainty":3},{"category":"data-model","id":"Q-3","impact":3,"impactReason":"Payment status shown to customers and staff.","options":["Unpaid past a single configurable payment term (e.g. 30 days from invoice date)","Payment terms set per customer company","No Overdue status in the first release"],"reason":"Overdue is required, and one global setting needs no extra customer fields.","recommended":"Unpaid past a single configurable payment term (e.g. 30 days from invoice date)","score":9,"spans":["I-16","I-5"],"text":"How does an invoice become Overdue?","uncertainty":3},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-4","impact":3,"impactReason":"Write records, and who can see them.","options":["Create, edit and retire on products, categories, price lists/prices, customer companies and users, with who/when and changed fields; admins only","Who/when only, no field-level detail; admins only","Same as the first option, but staff can also view it"],"reason":"Matches I-8, and section 3.4 gives audit viewing to admins.","recommended":"Create, edit and retire on products, categories, price lists/prices, customer companies and users, with who/when and changed fields; admins only","score":6,"spans":["I-8"],"text":"Which customer-account and catalogue changes go in the audit history, and who can view it?","topic":"audit","uncertainty":2},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-5","impact":3,"impactReason":"Customer write permission on address records.","options":["No: customers select from addresses managed by staff/admin","Yes: buyers can add and edit their company's addresses","Customers can request changes, and staff approve them"],"reason":"The buyer capability is only 'View their company's addresses'.","recommended":"No: customers select from addresses managed by staff/admin","score":6,"spans":["I-13","I-17"],"text":"Can customers create or edit their own delivery addresses?","uncertainty":2}],"assumptions":[{"fromQuestion":"Q-3","fromSpan":["I-13","I-15"],"id":"ASM-1","risk":"low","text":"Are saved basket templates (section 16) in scope? They are listed for Buyers but missing from the intent list. → assumed: Out of scope for this release"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-5","fromSpan":["I-17","I-6"],"id":"ASM-2","risk":"high","text":"Who maintains customer company records (name, account number, billing address, addresses, active status): Office Staff, Administrators, or both? → assumed: Administrators only; staff can view"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-6","fromSpan":["I-3","I-12"],"id":"ASM-3","risk":"low","text":"How is 'low stock' decided, and is the threshold fixed or configurable? → assumed: One global quantity threshold, configurable by admin in system settings"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-7","fromSpan":["I-3","I-13"],"id":"ASM-4","risk":"high","text":"If an out-of-stock product (or a quantity above stock) is in the basket, what happens? → assumed: The product can't be added and checkout is blocked until the line is reduced or removed"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-8","fromSpan":["I-3","I-11"],"id":"ASM-5","risk":"high","text":"If a product has no price on the customer's assigned price list, how is it shown? → assumed: Shown with 'price on request' and cannot be added to the basket"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-9","fromSpan":["I-11","I-16"],"id":"ASM-6","risk":"high","text":"Are prices tax-exclusive or tax-inclusive, and do invoices show tax? → assumed: Prices are net (tax-exclusive) with one configurable tax rate added on invoices"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-11","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-7","risk":"low","text":"How does the nightly ERP CSV reach the portal, and what are its columns? → assumed: The scheduled job reads the file from a configured folder or SFTP location in an agreed column format (product code, quantity)"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-12","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-8","risk":"high","text":"If the ERP CSV contains product identifiers the portal doesn't know, or a product is missing from the file, what happens? → assumed: Unknown rows are skipped and reported; products missing from the file keep their previous stock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-13","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-9","risk":"low","text":"Are the 14:00 cutoff, the non-working days and the timezone fixed or configurable, and how are public holidays handled? → assumed: Cutoff, timezone, weekly non-working days and a list of holiday dates all set by admin in system settings"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-14","fromSpan":["I-14","I-4"],"id":"ASM-10","risk":"low","text":"Does the cutoff rule apply to staff-created orders too, or can staff choose any date? → assumed: The same cutoff rule applies to staff-created orders"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-15","fromSpan":["I-14"],"id":"ASM-11","risk":"high","text":"Which status transitions can staff make after confirmation? Can they skip steps or go back, and can they cancel a Confirmed or Picking order? → assumed: Forward one step at a time only; staff can cancel any order up to Out for delivery"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-16","fromSpan":["I-14"],"id":"ASM-12","risk":"low","text":"Should a rejected order use a separate Rejected status, or become Cancelled with a reason? → assumed: Cancelled, with the rejection reason recorded"},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-17","fromSpan":["I-14"],"id":"ASM-13","risk":"low","text":"Who receives order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out-for-delivery), including for staff-created orders? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-18","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-14","risk":"low","text":"When a user moves from viewing to checkout, is the basket kept across sessions? → assumed: Kept only for the current session"},{"fromDefault":"data-migration","fromQuestion":"Q-19","fromSpan":["I-10","I-11","I-17"],"id":"ASM-15","risk":"high","text":"Do existing customers, products, price lists and compatibility data need to be loaded at launch? → assumed: No; the system starts empty, with seed data for set-up."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-20","fromSpan":["I-10","I-2"],"id":"ASM-16","risk":"low","text":"Where does vehicle compatibility data come from? → assumed: Entered manually by admins on each product"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-21","fromSpan":["I-10","I-2"],"id":"ASM-17","risk":"low","text":"Are categories flat or nested